# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# VENDORED EXCEPTION: app/debug.keystore is the cert every build ever
# shipped under is signed with (the machine's original debug key, known
# default passwords, no secret in it). Committed so release builds are
# signature-STABLE across machines and reinstalls of ~/.android: an APK
# signed with a different key cannot update an installed app — Android
# refuses with INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE. Replacing this file
# means every installed phone must UNINSTALL before it can take the
# next build.
!/app/debug.keystore
